keel-overlay-wireguard (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First release (handbook decision 0041, first implementation, step 2).
    Depends on trixie's wireguard-tools 1.0.20210914; ships the overlay
    manifest of docs/manifest-v1.md as
    /usr/share/keel/overlays/wireguard.yaml. No process and no unit: the
    interface is the instance spec's (decisions 0018 and 0020).

